From: Codex <codex@openai.com>
Subject: [PATCH] whyred: expose validated eMMC GPT partitions as read-only BSD disks

Keep the existing RAM disk as the default root. Add opt-in early eMMC init
for a read-only GPT partition block device, plus an explicit root selector for
future filesystem bring-up. Writes and out-of-partition requests fail closed.

--- a/bsd/dev/whyred_emmc_pio_probe.c
+++ b/bsd/dev/whyred_emmc_pio_probe.c
@@ -8,6 +8,13 @@
  */
 #include <sys/param.h>
 #include <sys/systm.h>
